  "description": "This walk visits the Hook Moor Wind Farm from the Lotherton Hall Estate near Garforth and Leeds. The moor is a fine place for a walk with excellent countryside views and good footpaths. There's also some peaceful woodland trails through the adjacent Ringhay Wood. The route includes a visit to Lotherton Hall where you can explore the deer park and gardens on a series of surfaced paths.",
